.br
\fIReceiveMessage\fR The decoded message containing options and payload.
.TP
\fBreceive(callback)\fR
Registers a callback to handle incoming messages. The callback will receive an error object and an object containing decoded options and payload.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIcallback\fR (ReceiveCallback; required) The callback function to handle incoming messages.
.TP
\fBsend(options, payload)\fR
