\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIoptions\fR (object; required) The options to send.
.br
\fIpayload\fR (Uint8Array; optional; default null) The payload to send.
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIboolean\fR
.TP
\fBclose()\fR
Closes the WebSocket connection, preventing reconnects.
